      "text": {
        "jp": "「変幻自在な敵と渡り合い、弱みを貫け」\r\n……って書いてあるな。",
        "official_en": "It says, “An ever-shifting foe blocks your path; strike its weakness, and unleash your wrath.”",
        "real_en": "It says, 'Face a foe that changes form, and strike at its weakness.'"
